
 Usage: oria feishu-demo [OPTIONS]

 Run the explicit synthetic Feishu walkthrough on loopback; no production Jobs.

╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ *  --config          <path>                     Private discovered OriaTest  │
│                                                 scope (0600).                │
│                                                 [required]                   │
│ *  --data-dir        <path>                     New, isolated synthetic      │
│                                                 demonstration directory.     │
│                                                 [required]                   │
│    --port            <int range> [1<=x<=65535]  [default: 8018]              │
│    --seconds         <int range> [1<=x<=1800]   [default: 1800]              │
│    --help                                       Show this message and exit.  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

